<mxCell id="c590" value="checkpoints.type, template_questions.type (free text)&lt;br&gt;→ equipmentTypeId → equipment_types&lt;br&gt;users.role (free text) → roleId → roles; admin rights&lt;br&gt;listed in permissions via role_permissions&lt;br&gt;inspections.reportFileName → reports (every generated&lt;br&gt;/ regenerated PDF, who made it, how often shared)&lt;br&gt;statusTags (comma-separated text) on inspections and&lt;br&gt;captured_inspections → status_tags + junction tables&lt;br&gt;syncedAt / syncConflict on inspections, photos,&lt;br&gt;corrective_actions → sync_runs + sync_items&lt;br&gt;7 id columns without a constraint (areaId, itemId,&lt;br&gt;actionId, 4 user ids) → real FOREIGN KEYs, ON DELETE&lt;br&gt;SET NULL&lt;br&gt;New data not stored today: chat conversations +&lt;br&gt;messages, voice notes, overdue-action notifications" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=10.5;fontColor=#1e293b;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;" vertex="1" parent="g_note587"><mxGeometry x="7.0" y="20.0" width="286.0" height="211.9" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
